J(\mathbf{w},b) = -\frac{1}{m} \left[ \sum_{i=1}^{m} \sum_{j=1}^{N} 1\left\{y^{(i)} == j\right\} \log \frac{e^{z^{(i)__j}}{\sum_{k=1}^N e^{z^{(i)__k} }\right] \thẻ{4}
